The function `normalizeTimeframeMinutes` is called on lines 26 and 49 but is not defined in this file or in `service-worker-utils.js`. This will cause a `ReferenceError` when the settings page is loaded or saved. Please define this helper function to ensure the extension remains functional.

```javascript
const SETTINGS_EXPORT_VERSION = 1;
const SETTING_KEYS = Object.keys(DEFAULT_SETTINGS);

function normalizeTimeframeMinutes(value) {
  const minutes = parseInt(value, 10);
  return Number.isFinite(minutes) && minutes > 0 ? minutes : 60;
}
```

